# ATS Platform — React Frontend Implementation Plan

## Backend Summary

Your backend is an **AI-powered Applicant Tracking System** built with:
- **Express + TypeScript** on port `5000`, all routes under `/api`
- **MongoDB** (Mongoose) with models: User, Candidate, Job, Interview, MatchingResult, Offer, CandidatePortalCredentials
- **JWT auth** (Bearer token, refresh token)
- **AI services**: Gemini (resume parsing, AI summary), Pinecone (semantic search), Ollama (local LLM)
- **Cloudinary** for resume file storage
- **Gmail API** for email ingestion + Nodemailer for outbound email

### Key API Endpoints

| Module | Endpoints |
|---|---|
| Auth | `POST /register`, `POST /login`, `POST /refresh-token`, `GET /profile` |
| Candidates | `GET/POST /candidates`, `GET/PUT/DELETE /candidates/:id`, `PATCH /candidates/:id/status` |
| Resumes | `POST /resumes/upload`, `POST /resumes/process` |
| Jobs | `GET/POST /jobs`, `GET/PUT/DELETE /jobs/:id` |
| Matching | `POST /matching/job/:jobId`, `GET /matching/job/:jobId/results` |
| Interviews | `GET/POST /interviews`, `GET /interviews/:id` |
| Portal | `POST /portal/login`, `GET /portal/profile`, `GET /portal/status` |
| Email | `POST /emails/send`, `POST /emails/ingest-resumes` |
| Notifications | `POST /notifications/candidate-status` |
| Analytics | `GET /analytics/dashboard`, `GET /analytics/jobs`, `GET /analytics/candidates` |

### Roles: `admin`, `recruiter`, `candidate`

