## Pages Overview

### 1. Login / Register
- Centered card, gradient accent border
- Email + password fields, role selector (register only)
- JWT stored in localStorage, refresh token rotation

### 2. Dashboard
- 7 KPI metric cards (total candidates, open jobs, shortlisted, etc.)
- Candidate status pie chart
- Job status breakdown bar chart
- Recent candidates table

### 3. Candidates
- Searchable, filterable table (status, source)
- Click row → detail page
- Status badge with color coding
- Bulk status update capability

### 4. Candidate Detail
- Profile header with AI summary
- Skills tags, experience timeline, education
- Status action buttons (shortlist, reject, select)
- Interview history, matching scores

### 5. Jobs
- Job cards grid/list toggle
- Status filter tabs (Draft, Open, Closed, Filled)
- Create job modal/form
- Click → Job detail with "Run Matching" button

### 6. Resume Upload
- Drag-and-drop file zone with progress indicator
- Supports PDF, DOCX, TXT
- Shows parsed result preview after upload

### 7. Matching Results
- Ranked candidate cards per job
- Score breakdown (semantic, skills, experience, project, education)
- Horizontal bar visualization for each score component
- Quick-action to shortlist/reject from results

### 8. Interviews
- Calendar-style list of scheduled interviews
- Schedule new interview form (candidate, job, round, date)
- Status badges (scheduled, completed, cancelled)

### 9. Analytics
- Candidate breakdown by status (pie)
- Candidate sources (bar)
- Top skills (horizontal bar)
- Job analytics — top matched jobs by avg score

### 10. Candidate Portal (separate route group)
- Simple login for candidates
- View application status, interview schedule, offer status

